# PR Merge Workflow

Load when running PR merge workflow, strategic merge, or `/merge-prs-to-develop`.

## Target and order

- **Target branch:** `develop` only
- **Merge order:** One PR at a time; no batch merges
- **Pre-merge:** CI must pass; branch must be up to date with develop

## Merge method

- Prefer squash for feature branches
- Use merge commit only when preserving full history is required

## Conflict resolution

- Document strategy per file before attempting merge
- Use merge plan doc (see `.cursor/skills/pr-merge-strategy/reference/merge-plan-format.md`)
- Reference conflict patterns: `.cursor/skills/pr-merge-strategy/reference/conflict-patterns.md`

## Reference

- Branch structure: `docs/guides/GIT_WORKFLOW_SETUP.md` (if present)
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/pr-merge-strategy/SKILL.md`
